<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African November business confidence index falls.</title>
<headline>S.African November business confidence index falls.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Chamber of Business said its business confidence index (1990 = 100) fell by 3.0 percentage points to 111.3 points in November from 114.3 points the previous month and 119.4 a year ago.</p>
<p>This month's figure was the lowest since August 1995 when it was at 110.1.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
